 and contains foci of fat necrosis  Multiple metallic clips are grossly appreciated within the scar  The remaining breast parenchyma contains predominantly tan yellow lobulated cut surface interspersed with minimal amount of fibrous tissue  There is no additional discrete mass or lesion grossly appreciated  The upper outer quadrant tissue is dissected for lymph nodes and no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  stellate scar to include entire cavity in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and closest posterior inked margin in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  inner lower quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  inner upper quadrant  Received fresh  labeled  right sentinel node 305   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan pink intact lymph node with minimally attached tan yellow lobulated adipose tissue  trisected and submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH 09   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 12 02 09PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART B  Lymph Node  Right   Sentinel  305   Excision  report_end  , Not reported.
