d with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  13 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 10 04 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast tissue  is a firm  tan pink fragment of tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  submitted entirely in A  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  Gerald Joseph Doyle  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  Catherine J Wu  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   INCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , No.
