men is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm biopsy cavity lined by smooth tan pink lining and surrounded by focal fat necrosis  In addition  there is firm fibrous tissue surrounding the biopsy cavity  up to 1 5cm  predominantly superior and anterior to the biopsy cavity abutting the blue inked margin at 6 o clock  The biopsy cavity is 0 2cm from the inferior  6 o clock  anterior margin  1 5cm from the underlying skin and posterior margin  and more than 2cm from all remaining margins  The remaining tissue is tan adipose tissue with scattered white fibrous areas  No lymph nodes are identified  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm white fibrous area  just lateral to the biopsy cavity and abutting the inferior margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity and inferior anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity and posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity and superior firm area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional biopsy cavity and inferior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrous area  lateral to biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section away from biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative sections Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of unremarkable tan skin strips  excised to a depth of 0 8cm  Representative sections are submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Nicole Ann Belsley M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Nicole Ann Belsley M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Nicole Ann Belsley M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Paula Arnell M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION , No.
