 not identified  However  in the vicinity of the aforementioned defect  the surrounding tissue is fibrotic  The remainder of the tissue consists mainly of focally firm  white fibrous tissue within which there are a few cysts and a few punctate  yellow foci  No lymph nodes are identified in the lateral aspect of the specimen  Representative sections are submitted as   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections of defect within the vicinity of the prior excision site   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections away from the defect  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional anterior left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm irregular portion of fibroadipose tissue which is not oriented  The tissue consists mainly of adipose tissue with a scant amount of intervening soft  white fibrous tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Tim Robinson  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Melinda J Lerwill M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  LEFT ADDITIONAL ANTERIOR   EXCISION , No.
